# With completed blocks hidden, a done @inbox project is not shown, so the next project tagged @inbox becomes the inbox.
file <<END
Old: @inbox @done(2026-01-01)
	- old
New: @inbox
	- new
END
keys gc gi
see - new
hide - old
keys <C-g>
see │▌ 󰚇 New                                     1 │
hide Projects
quit
